    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> is strong with you, and it gives you focus and vitality.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Training\" title=\"Force Training\">Force Training</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> Whenever you catch a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Second_Wind\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Second Wind\">Second Wind</a>, choose one expended <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> and return that power to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power_Suite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power Suite\">Force Power Suite</a>.</p>",
